  "A game master's screen glimpsed over the shoulder of a lantern-lit dungeon model, painted miniatures crowded around a collapsed tunnel.",
  "A thief pressed flat against a corridor wall as a patrolling guard's lantern sweeps past, a coil of thin cord and a pick in her hand.",
  "A desert crossing at high noon, a line of travellers wrapped in pale cloth trudging over rippled dunes beneath a merciless white sun.",
